# Public marketing homepage is the apex SPA document (HTTP 200).
# Legacy /landing URL permanently redirects to / for SEO + bookmarks.
/landing    /    301

# SPA fallback for client-side routes (React Router).
# Note: Cloudflare Pages still 308-redirects /index.html → / and
# /offline.html → /offline (Pretty URLs).
#
# Do NOT add `/assets/* … 404` rules here. On Cloudflare Pages that pattern
# broke subsequent SPA fallback in production deploy 8a799eb.
# Missing hashed assets may still receive index.html via this catch-all; the
# service worker rejects/scrubs text/html under /assets/* and script destinations
# instead of relying on Cloudflare for a dedicated asset 404.
/*    /index.html   200
